from opening.replay
# CP2: Sandgem lab and Pokédex, home for the journal and the parcel, the
# Route 202 catching tutorial. Yes on yes/no except the nickname.
# Inputs wait on the game (`until …`, `advance text`); walks hold a
# direction `until position`, running with B held; `+N` only follows a sync point (re-timed from a
# recording with tools/replays/retime.ts). Runs headless, also started late and on other seeds, in
# tests/integration/checkpoints.rom.test.ts.
# leave Lake Verity
+0 press down
until position 46 54
+0 release down
# east to Sandgem: the counterpart leads the way to the lab
